# Leyline of Mutation: "If this card is in your opening hand, you may begin the game with it on the battlefield" (CR 103.6a), and "You may pay
# {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} rather than pay the mana cost for spells you cast" (CR 118.9). Bot1 accepts, so the Leyline is on the battlefield from the start; the five
# Moxen make exactly {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, which pays for Blightsteel Colossus ({12}) as an alternative cost, so it is on the battlefield with the Leyline and
# the Moxen, all tapped and the hand empty of it. (A Colossus cast for its mana cost could not be paid with five mana.)

